      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110050,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー\r\n一声、かけたじゃないですかぁ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……\r\n机にお菓子を置く前にだな──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "細かいことはいいじゃないですかぁ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………確かに、作業が一段落したから\r\n一息入れようとは思ってたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……そう言って、\r\n仕事続けるのはどこの誰ですかねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　すまん、何か言ったか？\r\nあんまり聞こえなかった……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "いいえー、何もー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "それより、『ラーメンスープ』できたんで\r\nこの中に『麺』を搾ってくださぁい",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……ちょっとまってくれ\r\n今、搾り袋に『麺のもと』を入れてるから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──っと、よし……じゃあいくぞ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──お、おお、すごい『麺』だ！\r\n本当にラーメンみたいに見える……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただの粉と水だったのに……\r\nすごいもんだなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……はしゃぎすぎじゃないですかぁ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……前に摩美々からもらった『おすし』は\r\nこんなにうまく作れなかったから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサー、本当に作ったんですねー",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　そりゃあ、摩美々がくれたものだし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "いい大人が、ひとりでお菓子作りですかぁ？\r\n……ふふー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……なんだ？\r\n摩美々からすすめておいて、それを言うのか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "写真は撮ってないんですかぁ？\r\n送ってくださぁい",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……撮ってないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、他にも作るのあるんだから\r\n次、いくぞ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110150,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー、はぁい",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
