  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ん、んんん！？\r\n『ラーメン』見た目に反して味が衝撃的だ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうですねー\r\n見た目はしょっぱそうですからぁ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、なんだか懐かしい感じで美味いよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサーがリベンジした『おすし』も\r\n美味しいですよー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？　それならよかった\r\nはは、たまにはこうして息抜きするのも悪くないなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々のおかげで楽しい休憩時間になったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そうですかぁ？　そんなことより\r\nどんどん食べてくださいねー。こっちもどうぞー",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、グミかぁ\r\nこういうの子どもの頃よく作ったなぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この上にかかってる\r\n甘酸っぱいパウダーがいいアクセントに──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "────────！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "048"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──すっぱ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "甘いお菓子だけじゃ飽きると思ってー\r\nすっぱいパウダーマシマシにしましたぁ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "────いやいやいや……\r\nこれ、脳天突き抜けるかと思ったぞ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110200,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "息抜きにはぁ、楽しいだけじゃなくて\r\nちょっとした刺激も必要だと思うんですよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでも、限度ってものが──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110210,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー、プロデューサーが涙目になるほど\r\n喜んでくれて、嬉しいですー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501011/2005010110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ま、摩美々……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005010110220,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "たぁっくさんあるんで\r\n残さず食べてくださいねー",
